-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Modifications (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- core/, cmd/wasm/, cmd/wmips/: port of pipeline.cpp, utils.cpp, mytypes.h and
  the non-UI logic of WinMIPS64Doc.cpp / IOView.cpp from C++/MFC to Go.
- tools/oracle/: native (non-Windows) build of the original simulator core;
  tools/oracle/src/ holds an adapted copy of the WinMIPS64Doc.cpp logic and
  tools/oracle/shim/mytypes.h a copy with fixed-width integer typedefs.
- web/: new React user interface that reproduces the original MFC windows.
- third_party/: unmodified copies of both upstream repositories (compiled
  binaries removed).
